  "question": {
    "text": "A small block slides with velocity <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><msqrt><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi></msqrt></math> on the horizontal frictionless surface as shown in the figure. The block leaves the surface at a point <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>. What is the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cosθ</mi></math>?<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0089_ae76f1d0721e.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"height: 123px; width: 200px;\" />"
  },
